# Sponsors

Writing code is being automated. Long-term vision and ownership of software systems are not. When the stakes are high, you want an experienced engineer who can keep the system coherent and take responsibility for it. That's who we build Rune for.

Rune is free and open source, built entirely through open-source contributions and stewarded by Unstable Build, a small, self-funded company. Independent and user-supported: your sponsorship keeps it that way. See the tiers section for more details.

